#: options.cpp:168
msgid "X default codes"
msgstr "Verstek X-kodes"

#: options.cpp:227
msgid ""
"%1\n"
"Do you want to configure now?"
msgstr ""
"%1\n"
"Wil u nou konfigureer?"

#: options.cpp:235
msgid ""
"You're using \"International Keyboard\" for the first time.\n"
"I installed a number of default settings."
msgstr ""
"Ek sien u gebruik \"Internasionale Sleutelbord\" vir die eerste keer.\n"
"Daarom het ek 'n aantal verstekinstellings gemaak."

#: options.cpp:383
msgid ""
"\n"
"Do you want to run configure?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Wil u 'n konfigurasie maak?"

#: options.cpp:393
msgid ""
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Wil u voortgaan?"

#: kikbd.cpp:166
msgid ""
"Only one instance of the keyboard controller\n"
"can run at a given moment."
msgstr ""
"Slegs een instansie van die sleutelbordbeheerder\n"
"kan op enige gegewe moment loop."

#: kikbd.cpp:168
msgid "Already running"
msgstr "Loop alreeds"

#: kikbd.cpp:257
msgid ""
"X codes \"%1\" file does not exist.\n"
"Using X default codes."
msgstr ""
"X-kodes \"%1\" lêer bestaan nie.\n"
"Verstek X-kodes sal gebruik word."
""

#: kikbd.cpp:283
msgid ""
"Keyboard map \"%1\" does not exists.\n"
"Skipping this map."
msgstr ""
"Sleutelbordkaart \"%1\" bestaan nie.\n"
"Kaart word geïgnoreer"

#: kikbd.cpp:299
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Opstelling"

#: kikbd.cpp:321 kikbd.cpp:334
msgid "Can not remove %1 from Modifiers.\n"
msgstr "Kan nie %1 uit Modifiseerders verwyder nie.\n"

#: kikbd.cpp:324
msgid "Can not add %1 to Modifier number 3.\n"
msgstr "Kan nie %1 tot Modifiseerder nommer 3 byvoeg nie.\n"

#: kikbd.cpp:346
msgid ""
"Can not set Mode Switch as %1 for keyboard %2.\n"
"Alt symbols disabled"
msgstr ""
"Kan nie %1 as modeskakelaar vir sleutelbord %2 gebruik nie.\n"
"Alt simbole is gesper"

#: kikbd.cpp:368
msgid ""
"Can't remove Caps Lock from Modifiers.\n"
"Caps Lock Emulation disabled"
msgstr ""
"Kan nie Caps Lock uit Modifiseerders verwyder nie.\n"
"Caps Lock emulasie is gesper"

#: kikbd.cpp:1027
msgid ""
"You're about to quit the \"International Keyboard\" tool.\n"
" Do you want to have it autostarted at your next login?"
msgstr ""
"You're about to quit the \"International Keyboard\" tool.\n"
" Do you want to have it autostarted at your next login?"

#: kikbd.cpp:1030
msgid "Exiting International Keyboard"
msgstr "Internasionale Sleutelbord word beëindig"

#: keymap.cpp:187
msgid "KeyMap: can't allocate memory"
msgstr "KeyMap: Kan nie geheue allokeer nie"

#: keymap.cpp:234
msgid ""
"Can't find symbol \"%1\".\n"
"Maybe your default X codes do not match.\n"
"You can preset X codes from section \"Advanced\"\n"
"in the configuration program."
msgstr ""
"Kan nie simbool \"%1\" vind nie.\n"
"Dalk stem u verstek X-kodes nie ooreen nie.\n"
"U kan X-kodes vooraf opstel in die gevorderde seksie\n"
"van hierdie konfigurasieprogram."

#: keymap.cpp:239
msgid "KeyMap: can't find symbol \"%1\"."
msgstr "KeyMap: Kon nie simbool \"%1\" vind nie."

#: keymap.cpp:247
msgid "KeyMap: can't read keycode \"%1\"."
msgstr "KeyMap: kan nie sleutelkode keycode=\"%1\" lees nie"

#: keymap.cpp:253
msgid "KeyMap: keycode \"%1\" is out of range."
msgstr "KeyMap: Sleutelkode keycode=\"%1\" is buite grense."
